  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacity for youth Agribusiness Development in Uganda (SCAD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Existing youth agribusinesses scaled up, new youth agribusinesses started, and youths gain employable agribusiness skills.&#xc6b0;&#xac04;&#xb2e4; &#xb0b4; &#xae30;&#xc874; &#xb18d;&#xc5c5;&#xc0ac;&#xc5c5;&#xc758; &#xd655;&#xc7a5; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0;, &#xc601;&#xb18d;&#xc778; &#xc2a4;&#xd0c0;&#xd2b8;&#xc5c5; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0;, &#xb18d;&#xc5c5; &#xae30;&#xc220; &#xad50;&#xc721;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xccad;&#xb144; &#xc601;&#xb18d;&#xc778; &#xc721;&#xc131; &#xd655;&#xb300;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot the agribusiness training program in a five districts in Uganda, Scale up the agribusiness training program to other districts in Uganda, Facilitate training and mentorship programs for youth on agribusiness aspects at the National Farmers&apos; Leadership Centre (NFLC) in Kampiringisa</narrative>
  </description>
